{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>ViuTV《悠長假期》當中AK江𤒹生破格飾演「黃子樂」一角，還原日版竹野內豐飾演的「葉山真二」。首支預告片曝光後，他重現經典動作兼展現瀟灑不羈氣質，令觀眾大呼驚喜。預告中他與飾演音樂系清純學妹「李芷媛」林愷鈴親密互動，瞬間成為焦點。</p>\n<h2>港版《悠長假期》預告江𤒹生重現經典托篋動作</h2>\n<p>劇組日前正式釋出首支絕密預告片，畫面中江𤒹生戴著特製造型演繹原著靈魂，更直接重現日版神級經典「膊頭托篋」霸氣動作。除此之外，片段亦閃過多個充滿電影感唯美場景，包括AK與林愷鈴傾訴心事、與數名知己熱血飲酒聚會等畫面。連串緊湊鏡頭徹底展現出江𤒹生駕馭破格角色功力。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17945841060477942_7978961786af72e2ae8569.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"悠長假期 江𤒹生 畫面中江𤒹生戴著特製造型演繹原著靈魂，更直接重現日版神級經典「膊頭托篋」霸氣動作。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17945841060477942_7978961786af72e2ae8569.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>畫面中江𤒹生戴著特製造型演繹原著靈魂，更直接重現日版神級經典「膊頭托篋」霸氣動作。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179458410817396427_18105149866af72e2c9e023.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"悠長假期 江𤒹生 二人於《繩角》一早有彈琴戲份（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179458410817396427_18105149866af72e2c9e023.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>二人於《繩角》一早有彈琴戲份（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179458411000838449_17347335306af72e2e6637e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"悠長假期 江𤒹生 兩人過往演藝履歷，已是這對螢幕情侶第3度合體碰撞出火花。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179458411000838449_17347335306af72e2e6637e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>兩人過往演藝履歷，已是這對螢幕情侶第3度合體碰撞出火花。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179458411075237476_9318597626af72e2f387da.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"悠長假期 江𤒹生 製作特輯預告，包括AK與林愷鈴傾訴心事情節。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179458411075237476_9318597626af72e2f387da.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>製作特輯預告，包括AK與林愷鈴傾訴心事情節。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>江𤒹生林愷鈴互讚對方呢個優點</h2>\n<p>江𤒹生飾演黃子樂與林愷鈴演繹李芷媛在港版《悠長假期》中有著極多對手戲，兩人更需要一同合奏鋼琴展現音樂火花。面對外界高度關注，雙方透過劇組直言經過早前多次磨合，如今合作起來非常順利，林愷鈴更大讚拍檔：「佢演戲好自然，絕對可以畀100分。」毫不掩飾對男方抱有百分百信任。</p>\n<h2>二人繼《繩角》與《冰上火花》後結緣</h2>\n<p>翻查兩人過往演藝履歷，今次經已是這對螢幕情侶第3度合體碰撞出火花。早於2022年熱播劇《繩角》中，江𤒹生化身熱血拳擊手與飾演鋼琴老師姜秀賢合演情侶，當時首日開工便要挑戰半裸沖涼場面，最終憑藉四手聯彈情節成功俘虜大眾。其後兩人於2023年再度加盟《冰上火花》劇組，男方出任冰球暴風隊隊長王天城，與女主角余悅在拍攝過程中進一步加深了解，為今次再續前緣奠定堅實基礎。</p>\n<h2>網民激讚江𤒹生瀟灑造型十足！</h2>\n<p>港版《悠長假期》預告片段火速在各大討論區洗版，不少網民紛紛留言大讚AK還原度較高，有人直指：「佢個不羈造型真係好有竹野內豐嗰種瀟灑感。」亦有評論認為劇集將為本地電視圈帶來全新衝擊，直言：「連托篋個動作都跟到足，真係睇得出製作團隊同演員好專業。」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179458411295231622_14787583336af72e316f4f0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"悠長假期 江𤒹生 兩人亦上過ChillClub合唱《繩角》片尾曲－《我們的相差》（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179458411295231622_14787583336af72e316f4f0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>兩人亦上過ChillClub合唱《繩角》片尾曲－《我們的相差》<br/>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179458411466220057_14180383636af72e330069b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"悠長假期 江𤒹生 （圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179458411466220057_14180383636af72e330069b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179458411594211463_543870366af72e34e72cb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"悠長假期 江𤒹生 （圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179458411594211463_543870366af72e34e72cb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179458411817377609_5533122836af72e3688239.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"悠長假期 江𤒹生 當時首日開工便要挑戰半裸沖涼場面，最終憑藉四手聯彈情節成功俘虜大眾。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179458411817377609_5533122836af72e3688239.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>當時首日開工便要挑戰半裸沖涼場面，最終憑藉四手聯彈情節成功俘虜大眾。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T16:03:42.958175+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1244,"images":8,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T15:35:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T16:58:26.278388+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T15:57:14.096961+00:00","content_hash":"d4600ce0c9b7b0074e1778824bdd756ba37034bc2376f1ce45def9ce3c24d86e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}